  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr><span style=\"font-size:36px\">本資源包相容的版本為<br>1.14 至 1.21.11<br></span><hr><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fspawn-egg-3d%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/386306/description_a8139ce0-eca7-4dba-994c-d5a5637a7e6d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"62\" height=\"62\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fspawn-egg-3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/386306/description_e8d22fd8-a35a-42d0-9e1b-0dd3f7ce245f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"62\" height=\"62\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/spawn-egg-3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/386306/description_36ca38cd-27c2-420a-a606-186c0ef4ebb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"62\" height=\"62\"></a><br></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LilA3tqIZ6k?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">英文說明<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此資源包將生成蛋替換為與該生成蛋關聯的生物的 3D 模型。</span></div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">已設定為與物品展示框相符。若 Minecraft 新增了新生物，<br>我將把該生物的生成蛋替換為其 3D 模型並發布更新。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">葡萄牙語（巴西）說明</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此資源包將生成蛋替換為與該生成蛋關聯的生物的 3D 模型。已設定為與物品展示框相符。若 Minecraft 新增了新生物，我將把該生物的生成蛋替換為其 3D 模型並發布更新。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">日文說明</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此資源包將生成蛋替換為與該生成蛋關聯的生物的 3D 模型。已設定為與物品展示框相符。當 Minecraft 新增新生物時，我將把該生物的生成蛋替換為其 3D 模型並發布。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/300/550/fefeefefef.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/300/551/ddddddddd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2024/056/18285863-ffwevw_l.webp\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1152\"><br></span></p>",
